# heed's intro sting (about 1.5 s): the owl in its pill, typing its name. Recorded once into intro.mov, which
# heed.reelpreset uses as every film's intro. Re-record with: mise run reels brand/intro
Open intro.html
Output intro.mov
# Chromium, not WebKit: reel's WebKit capture does not advance CSS animations. A tiling window manager must let it float.
Set Browser chromium
Set Viewport 1280x720
Set Cursor off
Sleep 1.3s
